            "sid": "JER 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shewed me, and, behold, two baskets of figs",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "set before the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", after that Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon had carried away captive Jeconiah the son of Jehoiakim king of Judah, and the princes of Judah, with the carpenters and smiths, from Jerusalem, and had brought them to Babylon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One basket",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "had",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "very good figs,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like the figs",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "first ripe: and the other basket",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "had",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "very naughty figs, which could not be eaten, they were so bad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto me, What seest thou, Jeremiah? And I said, Figs; the good figs, very good; and the evil, very evil, that cannot be eaten, they are so evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Again the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel; Like these good figs, so will I acknowledge them that are carried away captive of Judah, whom I have sent out of this place into the land of the Chaldeans for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I will set mine eyes upon them for good, and I will bring them again to this land: and I will build them, and not pull",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "down; and I will plant them, and not pluck",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will give them an heart to know me, that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": and they shall be my people, and I will be their God: for they shall return unto me with their whole heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And as the evil figs, which cannot be eaten, they are so evil; surely thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", So will I give Zedekiah the king of Judah, and his princes, and the residue of Jerusalem, that remain in this land, and them that dwell in the land of Egypt:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will deliver them to be removed into all the kingdoms of the earth for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hurt,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a reproach and a proverb, a taunt and a curse, in all places whither I shall drive them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will send the sword, the famine, and the pestilence, among them, till they be consumed from off the land that I gave unto them and to their fathers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
